   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">We provided a $30 million anchor commitment to Axian Telecom&#xfffd;s public bond offering. The company is a fast-growing provider of telecoms services and infrastructure in Madagascar, Togo, Tanzania, Senegal, Comoros, Mayotte, Reunion and Uganda.As of March 31st 2025, the Group served 40.8 million mobile customers, operating across markets with a total population of 130.7 million. By providing vital telecoms services and infrastructure, the company is increasing access to affordable mobile and data services for customers, including rural and lower-income populations.</narrative>
   </description>
